{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-closure-client-plan-r1\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\", \"kind\": \"route\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"53d572ba3265d77835a49ee92441c7ce26ea7faa\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002031\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015/plan-review-package-r1.txt\": \"5650ec14cbf338441f58aee96fae7b5c119bb42a8eaf3fbdb4bee47c8b91e622\"}}, \"claims\": [\"方案定义只读空命令与原四命令两种精确合同，保留原tenant/privacy/falseflags，未知或部分列表不能被扩成权限。\", \"文件范围和RED、相邻冻结回归、独立质量及真实SDK联动后续门明确；方案不宣称未实施代码或完整经营已完成。\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015/plan-review-package-r1.txt\": \"Before-code DESIGN/ROUTE review only, not claimedimplementation/realUIcompletion. Backend53 realOIDC GET200 commands[] is frozen, oldparse rejects it. NewTask scope2client files/nonoverlap. Code/native/fullbusiness gates remain afterplan.\\n# Creator closure只读命令列表前端合同\\n\\nRules/AGENTS/231/fullGoal/base2031，同owner独立Task精确parser.ts与threeModuleClosureClient.test.ts。原code53 API72678、Web64614仍6bf；后台真人list200/四null+四blocker/commands[]/falseflags已证明，不能当旧client成功。已查实际parseThreeModuleClosureContributionView硬要求four.join且输出固定四命令，故readonly[]被拒绝。旧测试只有四命令，无空readonly反例。\\n\\n只改该函数两个判断/输出点，不动其他parser/client请求/组件/CSS/锁文件或后台。命令合同仅两种：空数组（readonly）或原四命令逐元素、同长度、同顺序完全一致；partial/unknown/reorder/single pipe-joined拒绝，避免join字符串等价被扩成四权限。返回commands为相应已验证列表空或四，不伪造/补全。schemaVersion/tenant/module/全字段/隐私/禁止consume/promotion/external flags所有现有校验保留。empty不能绕过flags false要求。正常四命令客户端及原服务保持不变，未来其他模块readonly[]同合同可解析但本波后台不放行price/customer。\\n\\n先独立route方案，RED新增readonly[]保留、legacy4、partial/reorder/unknown/pipejoined与emptyflags true/tenant/PII拒绝，再最小修复。针对threeModule client及相邻全Workshop/TypeScript，用已装依赖，源码前后SHA和精确冻结避免userdirty，独立code质量、精确提交后Web-only fresh维护控制器门，原API产品树不变和原PG/Chrome不signal；不是daily/aos fullPG/API/Web替代。原真人SDK方法及正式menu接口解析实读成功且commands[]，原三视口/canonical650只读不造闭环。现场Prime/精确各sliceDelivery/完整维护handoff/Authority七强/下一已登记helper。fullC真人预算/自然经营首链/安装全生命周期/八场景/视觉P1/连续观察发布Goal继续。\\n\\nEXACT EXISTING FUNC\\nexport function parseThreeModuleClosureContributionView(value: unknown, expectedModule?: ThreeModuleId, expectedTenant?: WorkshopTenant): ThreeModuleClosureContributionViewResponse { const raw = record(value, \\\"threeModule\\\"); exact(raw, [\\\"schemaVersion\\\", \\\"tenant\\\", \\\"module\\\", \\\"evaluatedAt\\\", \\\"atomicSkillIds\\\", \\\"logicId\\\", \\\"primaryColleague\\\", \\\"collaboratorColleagues\\\", \\\"latestClosure\\\", \\\"latestUsage\\\", \\\"latestEffect\\\", \\\"latestHandoff\\\", \\\"blockers\\\", \\\"allowedCommands\\\", \\\"handoffConsumeAllowed\\\", \\\"memoryPromotionAllowed\\\", \\\"externalEffectsAllowed\\\"], \\\"threeModule\\\"); const tenant = parseTenant(raw.tenant); const module = enumValue(raw.module, THREE_MODULE_IDS, \\\"threeModule.module\\\"); if (raw.schemaVersion !== THREE_MODULE_CLOSURE_SCHEMA_VERSION || (expectedModule && module !== expectedModule) || (expectedTenant && (tenant.orgId !== expectedTenant.orgId || tenant.projectId !== expectedTenant.projectId)) || !Array.isArray(raw.atomicSkillIds) || !raw.atomicSkillIds.length || !Array.isArray(raw.collaboratorColleagues) || !Array.isArray(raw.blockers) || !Array.isArray(raw.allowedCommands) || raw.allowedCommands.join(\\\"|\\\") !== THREE_MODULE_COMMANDS.join(\\\"|\\\") || raw.handoffConsumeAllowed !== false || raw.memoryPromotionAllowed !== false || raw.externalEffectsAllowed !== false) throw new TypeError(\\\"threeModule contract 漂移\\\"); const serialized = JSON.stringify(raw).toLowerCase(); for (const forbidden of [\\\"mobile\\\", \\\"openid\\\", \\\"email\\\", \\\"address\\\", \\\"contactvalue\\\", \\\"providerpayload\\\"]) if (serialized.includes(forbidden)) throw new TypeError(\\\"threeModule 泄露 PII/provider payload\\\"); return { schemaVersion: THREE_MODULE_CLOSURE_SCHEMA_VERSION, tenant, module, evaluatedAt: timestamp(raw.evaluatedAt, \\\"threeModule.evaluatedAt\\\"), atomicSkillIds: raw.atomicSkillIds.map((item) => boundedText(item, \\\"threeModule.skill\\\", 200)), logicId: boundedText(raw.logicId, \\\"threeModule.logicId\\\", 200), primaryColleague: boundedText(raw.primaryColleague, \\\"threeModule.primary\\\", 80), collaboratorColleagues: raw.collaboratorColleagues.map((item) => boundedText(item, \\\"threeModule.collaborator\\\", 80)), latestClosure: raw.latestClosure === null ? null : parseThreeModuleClosure(raw.latestClosure, tenant, module), latestUsage: raw.latestUsage === null ? null : parseThreeModuleUsage(raw.latestUsage, tenant), latestEffect: raw.latestEffect === null ? null : parseThreeModuleEffect(raw.latestEffect, tenant), latestHandoff: raw.latestHandoff === null ? null : parseThreeModuleHandoff(raw.latestHandoff, tenant), blockers: raw.blockers.map((item) => boundedText(item, \\\"threeModule.blocker\\\", 200)), allowedCommands: [...THREE_MODULE_COMMANDS], handoffConsumeAllowed: false, memoryPromotionAllowed: false, externalEffectsAllowed: false }; }\\nEXACT EXISTING TEST\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \\\"vitest\\\";\\nimport { EcommerceWorkshopClient } from \\\"./client\\\";\\n\\nconst payload = { schemaVersion: \\\"aos.ecommerce-workshop.three-module-closure/v1\\\", tenant: { orgId: \\\"org-org\\\", projectId: \\\"dev-project\\\" }, module: \\\"creator\\\", evaluatedAt: \\\"2026-08-25T09:00:00Z\\\", atomicSkillIds: [\\\"creator-batch-prepare\\\", \\\"creator-lane-reconcile\\\"], logicId: \\\"ecommerce-creator-growth\\\", primaryColleague: \\\"达人运营官\\\", collaboratorColleagues: [\\\"内容官\\\", \\\"数据参谋\\\"], latestClosure: null, latestUsage: null, latestEffect: null, latestHandoff: null, blockers: [\\\"THREE_MODULE_CLOSURE_NOT_COMPILED\\\", \\\"THREE_MODULE_USAGE_NOT_BOUND\\\", \\\"THREE_MODULE_EFFECT_NOT_BOUND\\\", \\\"THREE_MODULE_HANDOFF_NOT_BOUND\\\"], allowedCommands: [\\\"COMPILE_THREE_MODULE_CLOSURE\\\", \\\"BIND_CANONICAL_USAGE\\\", \\\"BIND_CANONICAL_EFFECT_REVIEW\\\", \\\"BIND_CANONICAL_HANDOFF\\\"], handoffConsumeAllowed: false, memoryPromotionAllowed: false, externalEffectsAllowed: false };\\nfunction client(body: unknown, calls: string[] = []) { return new EcommerceWorkshopClient({ getBaseUrl: () => \\\"http://127.0.0.1:8000\\\", getAuthHeaders: () => ({ \\\"X-Org-Id\\\": \\\"org-org\\\", \\\"X-Project-Id\\\": \\\"dev-project\\\" }), fetch: async (input) => { calls.push(String(input)); return new Response(JSON.stringify(body), { status: 200, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }); } }); }\\n\\ndescribe(\\\"three-module closure client\\\", () => {\\n  it(\\\"按 Module 读取五轴贡献且无动作权限\\\", async () => { const calls: string[] = []; const result = await client(payload, calls).getThreeModuleClosureContributionView(\\\"creator\\\"); expect(result.module).toBe(\\\"creator\\\"); expect(result.handoffConsumeAllowed).toBe(false); expect(result.memoryPromotionAllowed).toBe(false); expect(calls[0]).toContain(\\\"/views/creator/closure-contributions\\\"); });\\n  it(\\\"拒绝 Module 与路径期望漂移\\\", async () => { await expect(client({ ...payload, module: \\\"price\\\" }).getThreeModuleClosureContributionView(\\\"creator\\\")).rejects.toThrow(/module|漂移/); });\\n  it(\\\"拒绝 unknown usage 伪造 0\\\", async () => { const exact = { resourceType: \\\"ThreeModuleClosureRevision\\\", resourceId: \\\"closure-1\\\", revision: 1, contentHash: `sha256:${\\\"a\\\".repeat(64)}`, receiptId: \\\"receipt-closure-1\\\" }; const latestUsage = { tenant: payload.tenant, bindingId: \\\"usage-binding-1\\\", revision: 1, closureRef: exact, usageReceiptRef: { ...exact, resourceType: \\\"UsageReceipt\\\", resourceId: \\\"usage-1\\\", receiptId: \\\"usage-1\\\" }, lineageId: \\\"server-lineage\\\", quality: \\\"unknown\\\", quantity: 0, unit: \\\"tokens\\\", adjustmentTotal: 0, settlement: \\\"unknown\\\", contentHash: \\\"b\\\".repeat(64), boundAt: payload.evaluatedAt }; await expect(client({ ...payload, latestUsage }).getThreeModuleClosureContributionView(\\\"creator\\\")).rejects.toThrow(/伪 0/); });\\n  it(\\\"拒绝 PII 或 provider payload 泄漏\\\", async () => { await expect(client({ ...payload, blockers: [\\\"mobile\\\"] }).getThreeModuleClosureContributionView(\\\"creator\\\")).rejects.toThrow(/PII/); });\\n});\\n\"}}"}],"timestamp":1792016666661},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"request_id\": \"qyh-closure-client-plan-r1\",\n  \"task_id\": \"qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015\",\n  \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\",\n  \"kind\": \"route\",\n  \"baseline\": {\n    \"head\": \"53d572ba3265d77835a49ee92441c7ce26ea7faa\",\n    \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002031\",\n    \"files\": {\n      \".evidence/qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015/plan-review-package-r1.txt\": \"5650ec14cbf338441f58aee96fae7b5c119bb42a8eaf3fbdb4bee47c8b91e622\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"NEED_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"方案定义只读空命令与原四命令两种精确合同，保留原tenant/privacy/falseflags，未知或部分列表不能被扩成权限。\",\n      \"evidence\": \"材料 .evidence/qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015/plan-review-package-r1.txt 列出了原始函数与测试的确切代码片段，并指明要改两个判断/输出点；但材料未提供目标函数或测试的代码、SHA、PR 或完成状态，无法验证是否已实现空数组允许与 partial/unknown/reorder/pipe-joined 拒绝等约束。\",\n      \"assessment\": \"insufficient\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"文件范围和RED、相邻冻结回归、独立质量及真实SDK联动后续门明确；方案不宣称未实施代码或完整经营已完成。\",\n      \"evidence\": \"材料 .evidence/qyh-creator-closure-readonly-client-20261015/plan-review-package-r1.txt 包含前导声明“Before-code DESIGN/ROUTE review only, not claimed implementation/real UI completion”及关于范围、RED、相邻冻结、独立质量、真实 SDK 联动后续门的叙述；但材料未给出提交记录、测试结果、依赖清单或真实 SDK 联动的已完成证据，亦无具体文件/函数定位来核验。\",\n      \"assessment\": \"insufficient\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_safe_step\": \"提交 parser.ts、threeModuleClosureClient.test.ts 的代码或 SHA，并列出 RED 与相邻测试覆盖与失败/通过证据，便于复核方案是否已实现。\"\n}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider